    "src": "assets/018-neon/018-neon.png",
    "thumb": "thumbs/018-neon.png",
    "tags": [
      "Red",
      "Human",
      "Abstract"
    ],
    "description": "CONTOUR (1978)\n\nPhotographic print from original analog experiment shot on 35 mm film.\n\nCreated in 1978 as part of a series of light experiments using a projector and two torches, sculpting the edge of the body with minimal illumination. In the image, emptiness shapes what is seen: a tension between light and void.\n\nMEDIA:\n- Type: C-Type Fuji Flex (Super Gloss)\n- Weight: 255 GSM\n- Tone: Warm White\n- Finish: Ultra-high gloss with deep blacks and rich contrast\n\nFuji Flex lends the image a vivid, cinematic quality, with intense highlights, deep blacks and a reflective surface that accentuates every curve of light.\n\nDISPLAY TIP:\nFor best results, display on evenly lit walls and avoid direct spotlights to minimise glare.",
    "context1": "assets/018-neon/context1.png",
